After EVERY homepage/site commit on `revamp/environs`:

1. Sync public site files to repo `dikshashahi28/quintaearth-preview` (`main`) and push, so this URL updates itself:
   https://dikshashahi28.github.io/quintaearth-preview/
2. In the same chat reply, post that exact URL.
3. If the preview push fails, say so in chat. Do not ask Chief of Staff to refresh unless the push is blocked.
4. Do not wait for anyone else to refresh the preview.

Never use raw.githack.com, commit-hash preview URLs, or the live main URL as the “updated website” link.

Live site https://dikshashahi28.github.io/quintaearth/ stays untouched until Diksha says go-live. Do not push `quintaearth` `main`.
